@startuml
title Detailed Smeagol Flow

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Verdana"

skinparam participant {
    BackgroundColor<<Frontend>> LightBlue
    BorderColor<<Frontend>> Blue
    BackgroundColor<<Backend>> LightGreen
    BorderColor<<Backend>> Green
    BackgroundColor<<Service>> LightYellow
    BorderColor<<Service>> Orange
    BackgroundColor<<Database>> LightGray
    BorderColor<<Database>> Black
}

participant "SimFront" as SimFront <<Frontend>>
participant "SimBack" as SimBack <<Backend>>
participant "CalcEngine" as CalcEngine <<Service>>
participant "SaSViya" as SaSViya <<Service>>
database "DB" as DB <<Database>>

SimFront -> SimBack: POST /api/smeagol/run \n{ parameters: { ... } }
activate SimBack

note right of SimBack: Validate Request Parameters

SimBack -> CalcEngine: POST /calculate \n{ input: parameters }
activate CalcEngine
note right of CalcEngine: Perform Complex Math
CalcEngine --> SimBack: 200 OK \n{ results: { ... } }
deactivate CalcEngine

SimBack -> SaSViya: POST /analyze/risk \n{ calcResults: ... }
activate SaSViya
note right of SaSViya: Run Risk Models
SaSViya --> SimBack: 200 OK \n{ riskScore: 95.5 }
deactivate SaSViya

note right of SimBack: Aggregate Results

SimBack -> DB: INSERT INTO smeagol_runs \n(params, results, risk)
activate DB
DB --> SimBack: ID: 12345
deactivate DB

SimBack --> SimFront: 200 OK \n{ id: 12345, status: "COMPLETED" }
deactivate SimBack

@enduml
